<title>UK: Halma buys Volk for initial $9.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Halma buys Volk for initial $9.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Halma Plc said on Wednesday it has completed the purchase of Volk Optical, Inc. for $9.5 million in cash with a further $1.5 million payable later dependent upon the level of net assets and cash within Volk at completion.</p>
<p>Halma manufactures a number of products ranging from safety systems to environmental controls, while Volk, based in Cleveland, Ohio, manufactures precision aspheric lenses and optical systems.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
